  "title": "Pasta With Peanut Sauce",
  "description": "This peanut chicken pasta is made with bell pepper, green onion, and bean sprouts tossed with strips of cooked chicken and angel hair pasta and coated with an exotic blend of peanut butter, soy sauce, chicken broth, and fresh ginger.",
  "authors": [
    "MARBALET"
